&lt;p&gt;Censys offers a competitive benefits package to employees, including equity, health, dental &amp;amp; vision coverage, retirement with company contribution, parental leave, mental health &amp;amp; wellness benefits, flexible PTO, and a professional development stipend. Censys also offers sales incentive pay for most sales roles and an annual bonus plan for eligible non-sales roles. Censys’s compensation and benefits are subject to change and may be modified in the future.&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Please see our &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://censys.com/careers/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;careers page&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; for more details.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
