&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join the team turning internet intelligence into real-world security outcomes. Built on the world’s most comprehensive and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;cen016-po-underline&quot; href=&quot;https://censys.com/internet-map/&quot;&gt;accurate map of the Internet&lt;/a&gt;, the Censys Platform delivers real-time visibility and actionable intelligence needed to accelerate triage, investigate threats, hunt adversaries, and manage Internet exposure. We&#39;re trusted by half of the Fortune 500 and government agencies all around the world, and looking for people as passionate about the problems we&#39;re solving as we are.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Censys maps the entire Internet so security teams can see what attackers see and make the digital world safer. We are building our presence across Asia Pacific, and this role owns new-business sales for enterprise accounts in Singapore, our anchor market in ASEAN. Reporting to the Director of Sales, APJ, you will carry a quota against accounts of 2,500 employees and more, with a Sales Engineer, SDR support, channel partners, inbound marketing, and dedicated sales enablement and operations behind you. You will run the full cycle on large, multi-stakeholder deals, from first conversation through proof of value, negotiation, and close, and then hand off cleanly to Customer Success. Because the APJ team is still early, you will also help shape the regional sales playbook and improve the process you inherit. This is a role for an experienced enterprise security seller who enjoys the ambiguity of a growing region and wants to help a sales organization scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and close new business in ASEAN territory enterprise accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become a resident expert on Censys internet intelligence and the Censys platform, and position them to security, IT, and executive buyers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run complex, multi-stakeholder sales cycles involving executive sponsors, security leadership, and procurement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain a pipeline of qualified opportunities and keep an accurate forecast in Salesforce and Clari&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet quarterly activity, pipeline, and revenue goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate agreements based on the value Censys delivers rather than on discounting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Sales Engineering on proofs of value, with SDRs and marketing on outbound and inbound pipeline, and with channel managers on partner-sourced deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use the Censys sales stack (6sense, ZoomInfo, Outreach, Sales Navigator, Gong, Seismic) to prospect, engage, and learn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the APJ sales playbook, enablement content, and process improvements as the region grows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel to customer sites in ASEAN territory and the region as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates curiosity, a willingness to learn, and sound judgment in applying AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
