&lt;li&gt;Experience closing complex, multi-stakeholder deals using a solution or value-selling approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling into enterprise accounts in Singapore or the wider ASEAN region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled in virtual presentations, online demonstrations, and remote sales processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Salesforce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business fluency in English&lt;/li&gt;
