&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and grow the Pacific Northwest territory for a company that&#39;s just become the recognized leader in internet intelligence and attack surface management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run and close large, complex deals with multiple C-level and VP stakeholders at the region&#39;s top enterprise and cloud-native companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become a go-to expert on Censys&#39;s security data and SaaS platform — the same data powering threat intelligence, security research, and defense at scale globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently beat activity, pipeline, and revenue targets each quarter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a strong, accurately forecasted pipeline of qualified opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
