&lt;li&gt;Experience selling at early-stage or high-growth companies where you helped build the motion, not just run it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A consistent track record hitting or exceeding ~$1M quota&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Command of complex, multi-stakeholder sales cycles using solution-selling methodology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort and skill running a fully virtual/remote sales process, including executive-level virtual presentations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in Salesforce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel to customer sites in-region as needed&lt;/li&gt;
