&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join the team turning internet intelligence into real-world security outcomes. Built on the world’s most comprehensive and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;cen016-po-underline&quot; href=&quot;https://censys.com/internet-map/&quot;&gt;accurate map of the Internet&lt;/a&gt;, the Censys Platform delivers real-time visibility and actionable intelligence needed to accelerate triage, investigate threats, hunt adversaries, and manage Internet exposure. We&#39;re trusted by half of the Fortune 500 and government agencies all around the world, and looking for people as passionate about the problems we&#39;re solving as we are.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Censys is looking for an experienced, independent &lt;strong&gt;Marketing Manager (APJ Region)&lt;/strong&gt; to lead and execute regional marketing activities across Asia-Pacific and Japan. This person will serve as the extended arm of the global Marketing team in APJ, translating Censys’ global marketing strategy into programs that are relevant, effective, and impactful across the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with the Demand Team, APJ GTM organization and stakeholders across Censys, this role will own regional execution across industry events, webinars, virtual and in-person workshops, demand generation campaigns, content localization, and public relations. This is a hands-on role for someone who is comfortable being the first or primary marketer in a region. The successful candidate will be equally comfortable developing a regional plan, aligning with the global demand strategy and regional needs, managing agencies and vendors, and personally executing campaigns and programs.&lt;/p&gt;
