&lt;li&gt;Serve as the extended arm of the global Marketing team in APJ, translating Censys&#39;s global strategy into relevant regional programs and execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with the APJ GTM team to align marketing priorities with regional sales, pipeline, and growth objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute the APJ regional marketing plan, balancing global priorities with local market needs and opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Censys&#39;s participation in key APJ cybersecurity and technology industry events, including sponsorships, planning, execution, and follow-up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and execute Censys webinars with topics, speakers, and content relevant to APJ audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and run virtual and in-person Censys workshops to engage prospects, customers, and target accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute regional demand generation campaigns across paid, social, email, digital, events, and other relevant channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adapt and activate global campaigns for APJ, and build region-specific programs where local market requirements differ&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with global Content and Product Marketing to localize and adapt messaging around Censys&#39;s authoritative Internet Map and threat/exposure management capabilities for APJ audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own regional PR and media relations execution, aligned with global communications and brand strategy from HQ&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to build Censys brand awareness through media, thought leadership, events, partners, and regional communities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage regional agencies, vendors, event partners, budgets, timelines, and campaign logistics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Sales on target audiences, accounts, campaign follow-up, and pipeline acceleration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and analyze regional marketing performance — engagement, conversion, pipeline contribution, ROI — and optimize accordingly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain strong communication with HQ and APJ stakeholders, bringing regional insight back to global teams while independently driving execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with channel and distribution partners across APJ on joint marketing plans, campaigns, events, and demand generation programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply curiosity and sound judgment in leveraging AI tools to work faster and smarter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of B2B marketing experience, ideally within cybersecurity, security technology, or enterprise SaaS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as the first, primary, or highly autonomous marketer for an APJ region, with a track record of building regional programs while working within a global team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of APJ markets, with experience adapting global marketing strategies across different countries, audiences, and buying environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience executing industry events, webinars, field marketing programs, workshops, and demand generation campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering closely with regional Sales and GTM teams to support pipeline and revenue objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing PR agencies, media relationships, vendors, and external partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills, with the ability to run multiple campaigns and programs simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly independent and comfortable operating in a distributed, remote environment across time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and stakeholder-management skills, balancing regional needs with global priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical mindset, connecting marketing activity to measurable business outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with a modern B2B marketing stack — Salesforce, HubSpot, Zoom Events/Webinars, and Asana experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to use LLM and generative AI tools for marketing productivity, research, content development, and campaign execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in English required; fluency in Japanese, Korean, or Mandarin Chinese is a strong advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
