&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join the team turning internet intelligence into real-world security outcomes. Built on the world’s most comprehensive and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;cen016-po-underline&quot; href=&quot;https://censys.com/internet-map/&quot;&gt;accurate map of the Internet&lt;/a&gt;, the Censys Platform delivers real-time visibility and actionable intelligence needed to accelerate triage, investigate threats, hunt adversaries, and manage Internet exposure. We&#39;re trusted by half of the Fortune 500 and government agencies all around the world, and looking for people as passionate about the problems we&#39;re solving as we are.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Censys maps the Internet to make the digital world safer, and our SDR team is where many customer relationships begin. As a Sales Development Representative based in the UAE, you&#39;ll prospect organizations across the META region that would benefit from Censys&#39;s Internet intelligence and attack surface management solutions. You&#39;ll often be the first person a prospect hears from at Censys. Your goal is to start the right conversations, qualify them carefully, and set meetings that become pipeline for our Account Executives. You&#39;ll work with Account Executives and Marketing to sharpen targeting and messaging for the region. It&#39;s a fast-moving, inclusive team and a strong place to grow your sales career.&lt;/p&gt;
