&lt;li&gt;Research commercial accounts to identify key initiatives and decision-makers, then spark interest through cold calls, email campaigns, and social selling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Listen closely to uncover customer needs and business challenges, and clearly connect them to how Censys can help&lt;/li&gt;
