&lt;li&gt;Partner with Marketing to continuously improve lead quality, conversion rates, and pipeline generation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates curiosity, a willingness to learn, and sound judgment in applying AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
