&lt;li&gt;Professional working proficiency in English, Arabic, and French, both written and spoken&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience with outbound prospecting by phone, email, or social&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with sales systems, specifically Salesforce, HubSpot, Outreach, and ZoomInfo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business and tech acumen, and the ability to understand customer needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly motivated, self-starting, with excellent time management and organizational skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in a fast-paced team environment and thrive in a remote-first setting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
